            "review_title": "Review at Mega Dunk Bistro Legend",
            "review_text": "Jena Ng\nHanoi, Vietnam6 contributions\n0\nMy experience.\nSep 2025 • Friends\nI had the opportunity to visit this restaurant in September. This restaurant is perfect for a beer with friends, plus a private room for couples or extended family gatherings who need private space. Diverse cuisine. The staff are friendly and welcoming, and because they are mainly young, they are very productive. It's more fun to go at night 👍🏼👍🏼👍🏼\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Chinese\nShow original\nWritten October 10, 2025",
