            "review_title": "Review at Mega Dunk Bistro Legend",
            "review_text": "Ji-woo\nHanoi, Vietnam5 contributions\n0\nA Vietnamese beer bar full of European sensation, Mega Dunks Bistro!\nSep 2025 • Friends\nAt the invitation of a Vietnamese partner, I went to the Mega Dunks Bistro, which was really an atmosphere like a European brewery. There are a variety of bio beers and imported beers, and the food and beer combined well so we had a good time. The atmosphere is vibrant and I like music and I want to go back.\nTranslated from Korean\nShow original\nWritten October 9, 2025",
