            "review_title": "Review at Mega Dunk Bistro Legend",
            "review_text": "Vũ Quỳnh San H\n2 contributions\n0\nOne of my favorite beer bars.\nOct 2025 • Friends\nI was very impressed by this bistro. The room was clean and tidy, with soft lighting and a relaxed and lively atmosphere. There are many kinds of beers, each one is very distinctive and smooth in taste, especially home-brewed beers, which taste very pure. The wine dish was also delicious and served just right. The waiter was warm and attentive, and served fast, making people feel comfortable. It's perfect for partying, chatting and relaxing with friends. Whether it's a weekend gathering or a holiday celebration, it's a good choice. We'll be back next time.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Chinese\nShow original\nWritten October 8, 2025",
